{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Batch and Multi-programmed operating systems"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about different types of operating systems."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Build the application installation program, using IT development tools available in the market, based on solution architecture features.  Understand the concepts of server, its characteristics and its relation with operating systems."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.  Exchanges simple information on the operating systems, server operating systems and relevant information related with the user manual."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Phrasal Verbs"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<b>Phrasal verbs</b> are two-word verbs made out of a verb and a preposition. It is not easy to identify their meaning at first glance as it is not literal."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Through the OS it is possible to set up other drivers and applications."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Before, a lot of time was wasted waiting for a computer to end up a process before starting a new one."}, {"type": "text", "content": "A <b>phrasal verb</b> is a combination of a verb plus a preposition, which together have a different meaning than the words separated. There are some important phrasal verbs that we have to learn:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":14,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>PHRASAL VERB\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>MEANING\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Catch up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to become equal or reach the same level\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Come across\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to find\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Drop by\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to visit in an unexpected way\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Drop out\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to stop attending a class\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Get at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to reach something\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Get through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to survive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Get up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to stand up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Go after\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to try to stop someone; to try to catch something\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Keep up with\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to stay at the same level\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Look into\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to investigate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Put up with\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to tolerate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Run into\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to find or meet someone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center><b>Improve on / upon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to make something better \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Batch and Multi-Programmed Operating Systems"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are different types of operating systems, depending on the needs of the user."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">A <b>batch operating system</b> is an operating system for users who need to process large amounts of information. It is an automated system which does not need manual intervention to avoid mistakes and speeds up the processing information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">Remember, a batch is a task which is done over and over again, so the batch operating system is programmed with specific commands, and then it starts processing all information without any other intervention. Here, we can be talking about millions of documents which need to be processed with the same command, which will be tedious and prone to mistakes if processed manually."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Multi-programmed operating systems</b> were introduced to solve the problem of main memory in computers. Before, computers had to wait for a process to finish before starting a new one. Multiprogramming aims to execute multiple tasks at the same time while multiple batches are being processed. This type of technology has provided a more dynamic approach to computers, prioritizing processes and tasks and improving efficiency of times.  "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "batch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group of jobs or data taken together"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This leads us to the batch operating system."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "capable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having the ability of doing something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In other words, the computer is capable of cutting off a program for some time, executing another one, and then going after other tasks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob04aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "CPU"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Central Process Unit, the part of a computer where the main instructions take place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(abbreviation)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This one analyzed the CPU activity and executed parts of programs simultaneously in the processor, giving the user the perception that they all are being executed at the same time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cut off "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cut or stop something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In other words, the computer is capable of cutting off a program for some time, executing another one, and then going after other tasks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lead "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to guide or show the way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This leads us to the batch operating system."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wasted "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used for no profit or benefit "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A lot of time was wasted waiting for a computer to end up a process before starting a new one."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob04aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for more information about multi programmed and simple batch Operating Systems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Identify the main features of multi programmed and simple batch Operating Systems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a brochure describing what multi programmed and simple batch Operating Systems are and mention their main features."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the grammar and the vocabulary related to this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your brochure with your class."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for more information about multi programmed and simple batch Operating Systems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify the main features of multi programmed and simple batch Operating Systems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a brochure describing what multi programmed and simple batch Operating Systems are and mention their main features."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the grammar and the vocabulary related to this lesson and I share my brochure with my class."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n6le02ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "enpe8n6le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Laura</b>: Today, I'm going to talk about batch and operating systems. However, if you want to learn about them, you will have to make sure you understand what an operating system is. </br>\n<b>Mark</b>: Yes, an operating system (OS) is the software that keeps a computer or device working. If you know how to handle and program them, you will have the opportunity to set up other drivers and applications.</br>"}, {"time": "26500", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Laura</b>: That's a good definition of an OS. Now, as not all users have the same needs, there are many types of OS in the market with different characteristics. This leads us to the batch operating system. This one used to be the way in which lots of information was processed in early operating systems. In simple words, they get a command and start processing automatically all the information. If you want to check this OS, you will have to keep in mind its three main parts: a control card interpreter, which reads and carries out the instructions; a loader, which loads programs and commands to the memory; and, driver devices, which give the special set-ups to each system."}, {"time": "77500", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Mark</b>: If a batch OS processes only one command at a time, will it mean that computers were slower, right?</br>\n<b>Laura</b>: Correct. That's where I wanted to get at. A lot of time was wasted waiting for a computer to end up a process before starting a new one. Luckily, we improved on that aspect and we launched the multiprogramming OS. This one analyzed the CPU activity and executed parts of programs simultaneously in the processor, giving the user the perception that they all are being executed at the same time. In other words, the computer is capable of cutting off a program for some time, executing another one, and then going after other tasks.</br>"}]}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}, {"